This single-skill package is a condensed, stage-oriented adaptation of the
workflow and craft methods in jtydhr88/screenwriting-skills, commit
51115f18d160aa8b2ac5813e4432b6f0b425358f:
https://github.com/jtydhr88/screenwriting-skills

The upstream MIT license is retained in LICENSE for adapted material.
The package also contains newly written stage-play guidance and original
structural case analyses. It does not bundle the upstream reference files,
book quotations, or play/translation text. Linked plays and translations
retain their own rights; check rights before reproducing or adapting them.
